            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We encountered a terminal lung cancer patient with severe back pain and dyspnea who refused the use of morphine, and succeeded in home palliative care with the use of an original prescription (CA), the main ingredient of which was codeine phosphate.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
